1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,890
Stop accepting ChatGPT's first answer, Dad.

2
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:05,290
It's very confident. Who am I to argue.

3
00:00:05,490 --> 00:00:08,650
The guy who has to tape it to the window!

4
00:00:08,850 --> 00:00:11,650
So I ask it to try again.

5
00:00:11,850 --> 00:00:14,060
Better! Ask for 3 versions, all different.

6
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:15,960
Short, funny, formal. Then pick one.

7
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:18,960
The short one. Always the short one.

8
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:22,000
Then tell it what you liked. It merges them.

9
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:24,200
Okay. Three versions, one sign.

10
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:26,610
Comment VERSIONS. Never take the first answer!

